  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the lazy-susan-spinner vessel over medium-high heat",
    "Add the sliced almonds to the vessel and cook until lightly toasted",
    "Add the chicken breast to the vessel and cook until browned on all sides",
    "Add the white asparagus to the vessel and cook until tender",
    "Add the olive oil, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper to the vessel and stir to combine",
    "Add the chicken broth to the vessel and bring to a boil",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes",
    "Stir in the cauliflower rice and cook until heated through",
    "Serve the paella hot, garnished with additional sliced almonds if desired"
